p."\n      ]\n    },\n    "CTV4500": {\n      "geometry_role": "nested_target",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "inside_or_closely_related_to_ptv",\n      "planning_role": "Clinical target volume inside or closely related to PTV4500.",\n      "inside_or_related_to": "PTV4500",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Coverage support is important when CTV coverage is failing or fragile.",\n        "Do not push CTV lower-bound DoseLevel above relevant PTV upper-bound DoseLevel.",\n        "Coordinate CTV coverage support with PTV hotspot control so target objectives do not become internally contradictory."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Bladder": {\n      "geometry_role": "overlapping_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "overlaps_or_directly_interfaces_with_ptv",\n      "overlaps_target": true,\n      "planning_role": "True OAR assumed to overlap or directly interface with PTV4500.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Prefer DVH-volume sparing and interface-helper control over global sub-prescription MaxDose.",\n        "Avoid tightening global MaxDose below prescription because target-overlap tissue may need prescription dose.",\n        "If bladder max dose is failing, reduce excess hotspot without creating a target coverage conflict.",\n        "Safe bladder sparing can still be pursued aggressively through DVH objectives when target robustness is maintained."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Rectum": {\n      "geometry_role": "overlapping_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "overlaps_or_directly_interfaces_with_ptv",\n      "overlaps_target": true,\n      "planning_role": "True OAR assumed to overlap or directly interface with PTV4500.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Prefer DVH-volume sparing and interface-helper control over global sub-prescription MaxDose.",\n        "Avoid tightening global MaxDose below prescription because target-overlap tissue may need prescription dose.",\n        "Continue safe DVH sparing when rectum goals have Pareto headroom and target robustness is maintained."\n      ]\n    },\n    "SmallBowel": {\n      "geometry_role": "case_dependent_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "unknown_or_case_dependent_relationship_to_ptv",\n      "overlaps_target": "unknown_or_case_dependent",\n      "planning_role": "True OAR whose spatial relationship to PTV may vary by patient.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Use current clinical goals and objective behavior to decide whether bowel sparing has safe headroom.",\n        "Sub-prescription DVH objectives may be reasonable, but avoid aggressive hotspot suppression that could conflict with target coverage.",\n        "If bowel max dose is failing, consider whether an associated interface helper or high-dose objective should control excess hotspot."\n      ]\n    },\n    "LargeBowel": {\n      "geometry_role": "case_dependent_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "unknown_or_case_dependent_relationship_to_ptv",\n      "overlaps_target": "unknown_or_case_dependent",\n      "planning_role": "True OAR whose spatial relationship to PTV may vary by patient.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Use current clinical goals and objective behavior to decide whether bowel sparing has safe headroom.",\n        "Sub-prescription DVH objectives may be reasonable, but avoid aggressive hotspot suppression that could conflict with target coverage.",\n        "If bowel max dose is failing, consider whether an associated interface helper or high-dose objective should control excess hotspot."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Femur_Head_R": {\n      "geometry_role": "separated_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "usually_separated_from_high_dose_target",\n      "overlaps_target": false,\n      "planning_role": "True OAR usually spatially separated from the high-dose target.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Sub-prescription upper-bound objectives may be reasonable when physically achievable.",\n        "Safe Pareto tightening is allowed, but do not over-prioritize if dose is already very low and not clinically limiting."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Femur_Head_L": {\n      "geometry_role": "separated_oar",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "usually_separated_from_high_dose_target",\n      "overlaps_target": false,\n      "planning_role": "True OAR usually spatially separated from the high-dose target.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Sub-prescription upper-bound objectives may be reasonable when physically achievable.",\n        "Safe Pareto tightening is allowed, but do not over-prioritize if dose is already very low and not clinically limiting."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Ring03mm": {\n      "geometry_role": "near_target_ring",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "outside_target_near_prescription_ring",\n      "planning_role": "Near-target conformity and prescription-dose spill control. This is the primary shaping structure for improving the conformity index clinical goal around PTV4500.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Use Ring03mm as the primary near-target conformity and prescription-dose spill control structure.",\n        "Ring03mm MaxDose should usually stay at prescription dose or below, especially when conformity is failing, borderline, or close to threshold.",\n        "Do not relax Ring03mm above prescription just to recover PTV coverage unless this is an explicit clinical trade-off with no safer deblocking option."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Ring15mm": {\n      "geometry_role": "falloff_ring",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "outside_target_mid_distance_falloff_ring",\n      "planning_role": "Mid-distance dose falloff control.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Use for mid-dose conformity and falloff.",\n        "Sub-prescription objectives are usually appropriate because the ring is assumed outside target.",\n        "Avoid repeated escalation unless falloff remains a dominant problem."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Ring30mm": {\n      "geometry_role": "falloff_ring",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "outside_target_low_dose_falloff_ring",\n      "planning_role": "Low-dose bath and distant falloff control.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Use for low-dose falloff.",\n        "Sub-prescription objectives are appropriate because the ring is assumed outside target.",\n        "Avoid over-weighting if target or OAR hard goals are more limiting."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Blad Opt": {\n      "geometry_role": "target_oar_interface_helper",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "target_adjacent_or_potential_target_overlap_helper",\n      "associated_oar": "Bladder",\n      "planning_role": "PTV-Bladder interface helper for localized high-dose control.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Assume this helper is target-adjacent or may include target-overlap interface tissue.",\n        "Use it to reduce excess interface hotspot, not to create a cold region at the PTV-Bladder interface.",\n        "Avoid pushing MaxDose well below prescription because this may compete with target coverage.",\n        "If lowering DoseLevel below prescription is considered, it should be modest, clearly justified by current plan evidence, and coordinated with target coverage support.",\n        "When target coverage is failing or fragile, prefer keeping this helper near prescription rather than aggressively below prescription."\n      ]\n    },\n    "Rec Opt": {\n      "geometry_role": "target_oar_interface_helper",\n      "default_geometry_assumption": "target_adjacent_or_potential_target_overlap_helper",\n      "associated_oar": "Rectum",\n      "planning_role": "PTV-Rectum interface helper for localized high-dose control.",\n      "planning_notes": [\n        "Assume this helper is target-adjacent or may include target-overlap interface tissue.",\n        "Use it to reduce excess interface hotspot, not to create a cold region at the PTV-Rectum interface.",\n        "Avoid pushing MaxDose well below prescription because this may compete with target coverage.",\n        "I